Read `.agents/rules/web-frontend.md` and `.agents/web-agent.md`.

- Templates in `app/web/templates/`; client logic in `app/web/static/app.js`.
- HTML pages in `app/web/routes.py`.
- Inspect and downloads use `/api` JSON from `app/web/static/app.js`.
- Tailwind/Flowbite via CDN.
